ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¡Esta noche es la cuenta atrás!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
¡Qué ilusión!{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0009:}}Espero aguantar
despierto hasta tan tarde.

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Heute Nacht steigt der {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Countdown{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ich bin sooo aufgeregt!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Aber was mach ich nur, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}wenn ich
vor Mitternacht einschlafe?!?

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Bu gece geri sayım var!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Çok heyecanlıyım!{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0009:}}Ama gece yarısına
kadar dayanabilir miyim{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} emin değilim!

{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Geri sayımda sağlam eğleneceğim!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}
Ama {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}dışarısı çok soğuk olur kesin; sıkı
giyinmeyi unutma,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!
